OL,3,GNEWSALondon mayor Sadiq Khan sworn into
OL,4,AHouse of Lords
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mayor of London, Sir Sadiq Khan,
OL,7,Fhas taken his place in the House of
OL,8,FLords.
OL,10,FSir Sadiq, who has become Lord Khan of
OL,11,FTooting, took the oath in the upper
OL,12,Fchamber at the start of business as he
OL,13,Fbecame a Labour member of the Lords.
OL,15,FLord Khan has become one of the
OL,16,Fforemost Labour politicians in Britain
OL,17,Fafter his decade as London mayor.
OL,19,FHis tenure, after being elected in
OL,20,F2016, has made him the longest-serving
OL,21,Fmayor of London since its creation in
OL,22,F2000.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
